  "materials_text": "MATERIALS\n ZipTipC18 Merck Millipore (EMD Millipore) \n MilliQ Water Contributed by users \n Acetonitrile Merck MilliporeSigma (Sigma-Aldrich) Catalog #34998 \n Pierce&trade; Trifluoroacetic Acid (TFA), Sequencing grade Thermo Fisher Catalog #28904 \n1. Kimwipes\n\n\n1. P-10 pipettor\n\n\n1. 1.5 mL microtubes\n\n\n1. 0,2 mL microtubes",
