    "section": "<p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "1. **Cleaning and preparation: **ACN100% (I)\n\n\nPipette the acetonitrile from the ACN100% (I) tube 10 times, discarding the contents on the kimwipes\n\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 35709,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "0",
