    "previous_guid": "082A60B07ECA11EA980E61C066769BB7",
    "section": "<p><strong>Prepae the materials and workspace</strong></p>",
    "section_color": "#A492FF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Fit the ZipTip with the pipette already attached, so as not to pass air through the &#34;chromatographic column&#34;. Hold down until you start the procedure with the first pipetting.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 35709,
    "case_id": 0,
